	.string "I'm working to preserve the\n"
	.string "natural ecology of POKéMON\p"
	.string "here.$"

BriskKanto_SixIsland_PatternBush_Frlg_2_Defeat:
	.string "Oh, for someone so young, you\n"
	.string "are tremendous!$"

BriskKanto_SixIsland_PatternBush_Frlg_2_After:
	.string "I'm not saying that you\n"
	.string "shouldn't catch POKéMON. I\p"
	.string "just want people to raise\n"
	.string "their POKéMON responsibly.$"

