	.string "Yeah, yeah, yeah! Look at all\n"
	.string "the BUG POKéMON!$"

BriskKanto_SixIsland_PatternBush_Frlg_5_Defeat:
	.string "I got beat while I was still\n"
	.string "busy celebrating!$"

BriskKanto_SixIsland_PatternBush_Frlg_5_After:
