	.string "I bet you think I'm just some\n"
	.string "guy, don't you, eh?$"

BriskKanto_SixIsland_PatternBush_Frlg_7_Defeat:
	.string "I bet you think I'm weak,\n"
	.string "don't you, eh?$"

BriskKanto_SixIsland_PatternBush_Frlg_7_After:
