	.string "Take a deep breath. Isn't the\n"
	.string "air delicious?$"

BriskKanto_SixIsland_PatternBush_Frlg_8_Defeat:
	.string "DALIA: You've given me\n"
	.string "something new to practice.$"

BriskKanto_SixIsland_PatternBush_Frlg_8_After:
	.string "First, exhale. Blow everything\n"
	.string "out. When you can't exhale\p"
	.string "anymore, inhale the clean air!\n"
	.string "Isn't it refreshing?$"

BriskKanto_SixIsland_PatternBush_Frlg_9::
