	.string "I love BUG POKéMON. That's why\n"
	.string "I'm here all the time. Am I\p"
	.string "the only girl like that?$"

BriskKanto_SixIsland_PatternBush_Frlg_9_Defeat:
	.string "I lost, but I'm still\n"
	.string "laughing. Am I the only girl\p"
	.string "like that?$"

BriskKanto_SixIsland_PatternBush_Frlg_9_After:
