BriskKanto_VermilionCity_Gym_Frlg_1_Intro:
	.string "LT. SURGE: Hoenn's Champion\n"
	.string "and savior! Your team\p"
	.string "protected a whole region.\n"
	.string "Let's see that bond in battle!$"

BriskKanto_VermilionCity_Gym_Frlg_1_Defeat:
	.string "LT. SURGE: I needed a better\n"
	.string "answer to that switch.$"

BriskKanto_VermilionCity_Gym_Frlg_1_After:
	.string "A little word of advice, kid!\n"
	.string "Electricity is sure powerful!\p"
	.string "But, it's useless against\n"
	.string "GROUND- type POKéMON!$"

BriskKanto_VermilionCity_Gym_Frlg_2::
	trainerbattle_single TRAINER_BRISK_KANTO_ENGINEER_BAILY, BriskKanto_VermilionCity_Gym_Frlg_2_Intro, BriskKanto_VermilionCity_Gym_Frlg_2_Defeat
	msgbox BriskKanto_VermilionCity_Gym_Frlg_2_After, MSGBOX_AUTOCLOSE
	end

BriskKanto_VermilionCity_Gym_Frlg_2_Intro:
	.string "I'm a lightweight, but I'm\n"
	.string "good with electricity! That's\p"
	.string "why I joined this GYM.$"

BriskKanto_VermilionCity_Gym_Frlg_2_Defeat:
	.string "Fried!$"

BriskKanto_VermilionCity_Gym_Frlg_2_After:
	.string "Okay, I'll talk! LT. SURGE\n"
	.string "said he hid door switches\p"
	.string "inside something.$"

BriskKanto_VermilionCity_Gym_Frlg_3::
	trainerbattle_single TRAINER_BRISK_KANTO_SAILOR_DWAYNE, BriskKanto_VermilionCity_Gym_Frlg_3_Intro, BriskKanto_VermilionCity_Gym_Frlg_3_Defeat
