	end

BriskKanto_VermilionCity_Gym_Frlg_4_Text:
	.string "Yo! Champ in the making! LT.\n"
	.string "SURGE has a nickname. People\p"
	.string "refer to him as the Lightning\n"
	.string "American! He's an expert on\p"
	.string "electric POKéMON.\n"
	.string "BIRD/WATER-type POKéMON match\p"
	.string "poorly against the ELECTRIC\n"
	.string "type. Beware of paralysis,\p"
	.string "too. LT. SURGE is very\n"
	.string "cautious. He's locked himself\p"
	.string "in, so it won't be easy\n"
	.string "getting to him.$"

