	.string "SURGE was my strict CO. He was\p"
	.string "a hard taskmaster.$"

BriskKanto_VermilionCity_Gym_Frlg_5_Defeat:
	.string "Stop! You're very good!$"

BriskKanto_VermilionCity_Gym_Frlg_5_After:
	.string "It's not easy opening that\n"
	.string "door. LT. SURGE was always\p"
	.string "famous for his cautious nature\n"
	.string "in the Army.$"

