	msgbox BriskKanto_VermilionCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Frlg_3_Text, MSGBOX_NPC
	end

BriskKanto_VermilionCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Frlg_3_Text:
	.string "Even if they are the same\n"
	.string "level, POKéMON can have very\p"
	.string "different stats and abilities.\n"
	.string "A POKéMON raised by a TRAINER\p"
	.string "is stronger than one in the\n"
	.string "wild.$"

BriskKanto_VermilionCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Frlg_4::
	msgbox BriskKanto_VermilionCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Frlg_4_Text, MSGBOX_NPC
	end

BriskKanto_VermilionCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Frlg_4_Text:
	.string "It is true that a higher-level\n"
	.string "POKéMON will be more powerful…\p"
	.string "But, all POKéMON will have\n"
	.string "weak points against specific\p"
	.string "types. So, there appears to be\n"
	.string "no universally strong POKéMON.$"

BriskKanto_VermilionCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Frlg_5::
	msgbox BriskKanto_VermilionCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Frlg_5_Text, MSGBOX_NPC
	end

BriskKanto_VermilionCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Frlg_5_Text:
	.string "The urge to battle with\n"
	.string "someone you've tangled with\p"
	.string "before… Have you ever had that\n"
	.string "urge? I'm sure you have. I\p"
	.string "wanted to battle certain\n"
	.string "people again over and over,\p"
	.string "too. So, I've been giving\n"
	.string "these away. Please, take one!$"

