	.string "Feature: VERMILION GYM LEADER\p"
	.string "LT. SURGE! LT. SURGE is\n"
	.string "rumored to have been a pilot\p"
	.string "while home in America. He used\n"
	.string "the electricity generated by\p"
	.string "POKéMON to power his plane.$"

